    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il se sert de tous ses sens pour se repérer, sauf celui de la vue. Un coup de ses sabots suffirait à séparer l’âme du corps de sa cible.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It probes its surroundings with all its senses save one—it doesn’t use its sense of sight. Spectrier’s kicks are said to separate soul from body.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "視覚　以外の　五感を　使い 様子を　探る。　蹴られたものは 魂を　抜かれてしまうという。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon friand de silence et de solitude galope à travers les ténèbres nocturnes et aspire l’énergie vitale des êtres endormis.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "As it dashes through the night, Spectrier absorbs the life-force of sleeping creatures. It craves silence and solitude.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "闇夜を　駆けぬけ　寝ているものの 生命エネルギーを　吸い取る。 孤独と　静寂を　好む。",
        "language": {
